  "offer": [
    {
      "speaker": "Bran",
      "text": "My forge hammer still thinks it is stamping armor for the old sentries. Fine for plates. Terrible for door hinges."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Bran",
      "text": "A Data Chip could teach it to follow a living hand again. Bring me one you can spare and I’ll pay 35 ore, two Ether Cells and 150 experience."
