  "accept": [
    {
      "speaker": "Bran",
      "text": "One Data Chip, loose in your pack. The gate’s Drone Sentinel carried one; the eastern road patrols use them too. An old find is just as useful as a new one."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Kaida",
      "text": "And if someone is using it?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Bran",
      "text": "Keep it on them until you decide. I won’t take equipment off anyone’s belt."
